      "href": "https://roundrockisd.schoology.com/page/8184072766",
      "content": "<div class=\"s-page-summary reset s-rte clearfix\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>DJ Arjun</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>\"Secondhand\" by Don Toliver [clean]<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span><span style=\"white-space:pre;\"></span></li>\n<li>\"Strangers\" by Giveon [clean]<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span></li>\n<li>\"Unholy Matrimony\" by Giveon [clean]<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span></li>\n<li>\"Gemstone\" by Don Toliver [clean]<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span></li>\n<li>\"Remind Me\" by Giveon [clean]<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>My music choices originate from the music my brother and I usually listen to in the car. This genre reflects how we hype ourselves up and are able to get into a better mood. All 5 of these songs are my personal favorites, and I like listening in every setting, no matter where or when.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Upcoming DJs: Elise</p></div>",
