        {
          "type": "assignment",
          "title": "Presentation: Hero's Journey",
          "href": "https://roundrockisd.schoology.com/assignment/8179422319",
          "assignmentDetails": {
            "score": null,
            "description": "<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:22pt;font-family:'Fjalla One', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;\">The Odyssey</span><span style=\"font-size:22pt;font-family:'Fjalla One', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"> Research Project &amp; Presentation</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Essential Question: How does one aspect of the hero’s journey in </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;\">The Odyssey</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"> relate to a modern-day hero story, when we attend to clues embedded in the text and contrast them with current news articles and biographical sources?</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;\">In pairs, create a presentation analyzing the hero’s journey in</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;\"> The Odyssey </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;\">compared to a modern day hero. Your presentation should include the following requirements:</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<ol style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Original title, image, student names, class period</span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">1 slide/page&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Formulate a response to the essential question. This should be an overview of your entire project, summarizing the synthesis of ideas. It is a 4-6 sentence introduction that compares the journeys of Odysseus and your hero at a high level. No text evidence is required.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Minimum 1 slide/page</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Evaluate Homer’s depiction of Odysseus’ journey </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;\">in the epic poem</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">. Summarize each step of the hero’s journey. Then, analyze one aspect of the hero’s journey in detail. Explain the aspect in your own words; </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">use and cite quotes/evidence </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">from text to support your ideas.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Minimum 1 slide/page</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Research and analyze a current news story for </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;\">a modern day hero</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">. Summarize each step of your modern person’s hero’s journey. Then, analyze one aspect of the hero’s journey in detail. Explain the aspect in your own words; </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">use and cite quotes/evidence</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"> from text to support your ideas.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Minimum 1 slide/page</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Comparative analysis paragraph: Analyze one step of the hero’s journey as it relates to Odysseus’s story and your modern person’s life. How do they compare? Incorporate facts, dates, </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">evidence</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">, and use MLA in-text citations. You may consider including an anecdote (personal experience or news story).</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Minimum 2 sources/1 slide</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Prepare 3 open-ended questions to facilitate class discussion about the topic.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">1 slide</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Create a Works Cited Page using MLA format.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">1 slide</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Remember to:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Make it visually appealing</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Make it engaging to your audience</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Divide the work equally&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Cite your sources4</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;\">Hero's Journey Steps:</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">The Ordinary World</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">The Call to Adventure</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Refusal</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Mentor/Helper</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Crossing the Threshold</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Tests/Allies/Enemies</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Approach</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Ordeal</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Reward</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Road Back</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Atonement</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\">Return</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><sp